  m_text: "Lemon trees (Citrus limon) are small, evergreen, citrus-producing trees
    originating from Asia, valued for their fragrant white flowers, glossy leaves,
    and tart yellow fruit. Thriving in warm, sunny climates, these trees can reach
    3\u20136 meters (10\u201320 feet) in height and are highly productive, often
    bearing fruit year-round"
